<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114126" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλᾱρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, only <i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>P.</u>
			9.38
		</span></i>
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλᾱρὸν</span> (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλιαρόν</span>
			)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> γελάσσαις</span> to laugh
				<i>exultingly, gaily</i> (fort. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλοαρόν</span>); but <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> has <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλαρόν: κόχλαξ;</span> also, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥυπαρόν, λεπτόν, τρυχαλέον,
					ὠχρόν</span>
			, and 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαιηρὸς κώθων</span>
			, Id.</div>
